00:00:32.282 --> 00:00:33.700
the attack was meant to divert attention

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:34.909
away from Russian forces

00:00:34.909 --> 00:00:35.910
claiming victory

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:36.995
in the battle for the eastern

00:00:36.995 --> 00:00:39.497
Ukrainian city of Mount over the weekend.

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:40.915
